### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 03 — SESSION LIFECYCLE
###
### Sessions are the top-level container for all agent interactions.
### Each session owns:
###   - A unique session ID (random UUID via SessionRegistry, Phase 64-B3+)
###   - A rolling chat memory store (max 20 messages, SQLite WAL)
###   - A ReAct checkpoint (StatefulAgentStore — agent loop state)
###   - A GovernanceLayer budget counter (per-session USD cap)
###   - A WorkspaceScoped CDI scope (torn down on DELETE/halt)
###
### Session endpoints:
###   POST   /api/v1/sessions              → create session
###   GET    /api/v1/sessions              → list all sessions
###   GET    /api/v1/sessions/{id}/status/{role} → poll checkpoint status
###   POST   /api/v1/sessions/{id}/run         → synchronous run (blocks until done)
###   POST   /api/v1/sessions/{id}/run-async   → async run (returns 202 immediately)
###   POST   /api/v1/sessions/{id}/approve?agentRole=coordinator → approve HITL
###   POST   /api/v1/sessions/{id}/deny?agentRole=coordinator   → deny HITL
###   DELETE /api/v1/sessions/{id}            → terminate and wipe session
###
### Checkpoint status values:
###   NO_ACTIVE_STATE    → no checkpoint exists for this session+role
###   IN_PROGRESS        → agent loop is running
###   AWAITING_APPROVAL  → paused for human approval
###   COMPLETED          → last run finished successfully
###   FAILED             → last run failed (deny, timeout, budget, error)
###
### After Phase 64-B3: session IDs are random UUIDs stored in session_registry.
###   (channelType=REST, channelId=sessionId, userId=apiKey) → UUID.randomUUID()
###
### Prerequisites: ArcClaw running in serve mode, GROQ_API_KEY set
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl  = http://localhost:8080
@validKey = key-internal-cWevfEoRvstUv0PqGpf02LzDY5kPNaz1y9GSl0LZOwU=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW A: CREATE + RUN + STATUS + DELETE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SESSION-1] Create a new session
# @name sessionA
# Expect 201: {"sessionId":"xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx"}
# Session ID is a random UUID (Phase 64-B3+), not MD5-derived.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-2] Status before any run — NO_ACTIVE_STATE
# Expect 200: {"sessionId":"...","status":"NO_ACTIVE_STATE","steps":[],"failReason":null}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionA.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-3] Synchronous run — blocks until agent finishes
# Expect 200: {"answer":"...","totalInputTokens":N,"totalOutputTokens":N}
# Audit events: CHECKPOINT_CREATED + LOOP_FINISH
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionA.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is the capital of France?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-4] Status after sync run — COMPLETED
# Expect 200: {"sessionId":"...","status":"COMPLETED","steps":[...],"failReason":null}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionA.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-5] List all sessions — sessionA must appear
# Expect 200: array containing sessionA's ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-6] Run a second goal on same session — chat memory accumulates
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionA.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What country is that capital in?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-7] Delete session — workspace wiped, CDI scope destroyed
# Expect 200 or 204: success
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionA.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-8] Status after delete — expect 404 or NO_ACTIVE_STATE
# Session is gone — checkpoint lookup finds nothing.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionA.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW B: ASYNC RUN (run-async returns 202 immediately)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SESSION-9] Create session for async test
# @name asyncSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-10] run-async — returns 202 immediately, agent runs in background
# Expect 202: {"sessionId":"...","status":"ACCEPTED"}
# Do NOT wait for completion — poll SESSION-11 to check progress.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{asyncSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run-async
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Explain SQLite WAL mode in exactly one sentence.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-11] Poll status immediately after async — may be IN_PROGRESS or COMPLETED
# Poll this repeatedly until status=COMPLETED (or FAILED).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{asyncSession.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{asyncSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW C: MULTI-TURN CONVERSATION (chat memory persistence)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SESSION-12] Create session for multi-turn test
# @name multiSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-13] Turn 1: establish a fact
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{multiSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "My favourite Java framework is Quarkus.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-14] Turn 2: recall from memory (no tools)
# Expect: agent recalls "Quarkus" from the rolling chat window.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{multiSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What Java framework did I just mention?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-15] Soft reset — wipes ReAct checkpoint, keeps chat memory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{multiSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "/reset",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-16] Turn 3 after reset: chat memory preserved
# Expect: agent still recalls "Quarkus" (chat window persists through reset).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{multiSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What framework were we discussing?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{multiSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW D: LOOP MAX ITERATIONS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SESSION-17] Create session for max iterations test
# @name maxIterSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-18] Run with maxIterations=1 on a complex multi-step goal
# The agent will exhaust its iteration budget before completing.
# Expect 200: answer contains partial result, audit shows LOOP_MAX_ITERATIONS.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{maxIterSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Write a 5000-word comprehensive analysis of every Quarkus extension available today.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-19] Verify LOOP_MAX_ITERATIONS in audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{maxIterSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{maxIterSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW E: ISOLATION — two sessions don't share context
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SESSION-20] Create two sessions
# @name isoA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# @name isoB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-21] Establish unique fact in session A
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{isoA.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "My secret code word is ARCCLAW-ISO-ALPHA.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-22] Session B must NOT know session A's code word
# Expect: agent answers "I don't know" or similar — NOT "ARCCLAW-ISO-ALPHA".
# Chat memories are per-session; workspaces are isolated.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{isoB.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is my secret code word?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{isoA.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{isoB.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW F: ERROR / EDGE CASES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [SESSION-ERR-1] Status on non-existent session → expect 404 or empty NO_ACTIVE_STATE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/00000000-dead-beef-0000-000000000000/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [SESSION-ERR-2] Run with invalid agentRole → expect 400
# @name errSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{errSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Hello",
    "agentRole": "DOES_NOT_EXIST",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-ERR-3] Run with missing goal → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{errSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [SESSION-ERR-4] Run with maxIterations=0 → expect 400 or treated as 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{errSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is 1+1?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 0
}

###

### [SESSION-ERR-5] Delete non-existent session → expect 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/00000000-dead-beef-0000-000000000000
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{errSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###
